# local editor/CLI tooling state (never part of the app; Tailwind v4's
# automatic content detection otherwise walks into these — .claude in
# particular contains sandboxed/masked files that crash Turbopack's build-
# time glob tracking when it isn't excluded here)
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
.mcp.json
